"Ah, that worked great! The librarians are fooled, for now. The place smells of oil and singed meat; you're reminded of a galleon you tried to raid loaded with barrels of Greek Fire and market cattle. That was a disaster, but how were you to know the barrels would explode and you'd be left with a cargo of extremely well-done steaks?","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":0.288,"end":21.888,"frac":0.984,"status":"ok","matched":61,"words":62},"large":{"start":0.288,"end":21.888,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":62,"words":62},"differ":false},{"i":1,"text":"Good times.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":23.36,"end":24.128,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":2,"words":2},"large":{"start":23.36,"end":24.128,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":2,"words":2},"differ":false},{"i":2,"text":"Back to business. You try to peek behind the counter towards the grill, hoping to see your previous cook. You catch a glimpse of Hungry Jack by the door and he beckons you outside.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":24.992,"end":35.584,"frac":0.971,"status":"ok","matched":33,"words":34},"large":{"start":24.992,"end":35.58,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":34,"words":34},"differ":false},{"i":3,"text":"\"I'm on a 15-minute break. Make it quick.\"","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":36.064,"end":39.392,"frac":0.889,"status":"ok","matched":8,"words":9},"large":{"start":36.064,"end":39.392,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":9,"words":9},"differ":false},{"i":4,"text":"You explain your need for a cook to keep the crew fed and satisfied.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":39.904,"end":43.616,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":14,"words":14},"large":{"start":39.904,"end":43.616,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":14,"words":14},"differ":false},{"i":5,"text":"\"Months at sea in a leaky boat? You're not selling me on the idea, Captain.\"","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":44.192,"end":49.984,"frac":0.933,"status":"ok","matched":14,"words":15},"large":{"start":44.192,"end":49.984,"frac":1.0,"status":"